</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>An object that evaluates to true if the operand is false.</para>
</simplesect>
The <computeroutput><ref refid="group__micro-os-plus-micro-test-plus-cpp-api-logical-functions_1gae82d39ac86167bb4bfa6624676f3729e" kindref="member">negate</ref></computeroutput> function template provides a generic logical negation for any expression type. It constructs a <computeroutput><ref refid="structmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1detail_1_1not__op" kindref="compound">detail::not_op</ref></computeroutput> logical negator object, which evaluates to <computeroutput>true</computeroutput> if the operand is false; the template argument is named, since the class template argument deduction would copy an operand that is itself a <computeroutput>not_op</computeroutput>, instead of negating it.</para>
<para>It is the function form of the <computeroutput>!</computeroutput> operator from the <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacemicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1operators" kindref="compound">micro_test_plus::operators</ref></computeroutput> namespace. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
